# Licensing — Community Life & Adolescent Development (CLAD)

This repository is **dual-licensed** by content type:

- **Data, documentation, figures, and the `clad-glimmer` graph** (everything under
  `data/`, `docs/`, `graph/`, `papers/`, `dissertation/`, and all `*.md`/`*.json`/`*.tsv`):
  **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)** —
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

- **Source code** (everything under `code/`, plus `graph/build_clad_graph.py`):
  **MIT License** — see [`code/LICENSE`](code/LICENSE).

> This supersedes the repository's previous blanket CC0 dedication.

If you reuse any of this work, please cite it per [`CITATION.cff`](CITATION.cff).

**No protected health information (PHI) and no subject-level controlled data are licensed or
distributed here** — see [`docs/data-governance.md`](docs/data-governance.md). Controlled-access
data are governed separately under the NIJ grant terms and a data-use agreement.
